sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Controller
    participant Service
    participant Repository
    participant Database

    Client->>Controller: Request
    Controller->>Service: Process
    Service->>Repository: Query
    Repository->>Database: Execute
    Database-->>Repository: Error (e.g., constraint violation)
    Repository-->>Service: Exception
    Service-->>Service: Handle Exception
    Service-->>Controller: Custom Error Response
    Controller-->>Client: HTTP Error Response (4xx/5xx)